   "subject": "Exponential model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<span style=\"color:rgb(2,8,23);background-color:rgb(249,250,251)\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">I want to run the model: </font></span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(2,8,23);background-color:rgb(249,250,251)\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">X = eta0 + eta1*(1-exp(-b2t)), </font></span></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(2,8,23);background-color:rgb(249,250,251)\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">where X is the variable &#39;correct essays&#39;, measured during 6 moments (V1, V2,..., V6) to the same subjects. Free parameters: eta0, eta1 and b2. </font></span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Sans Serif&quot;;font-size:x-large;background-color:rgb(249,250,251);color:rgb(2,8,23)\">My lavaan syntax is:</span><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b># Specifying the model </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>model &lt;- &#39;</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  # Latent variable definitions</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta0 =~ 1*V1 + 1*V2 + 1*V3 + 1*V4 + 1*V5 +\r\n1*V6</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta1 =~ lambda11*V1 + lambda21*V2 +\r\nlambda31*V3 + lambda41*V4 + lambda51*V5 + lambda61*V6</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  # Latent means</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta0 ~ 1</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta1 ~ 1</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  # Latent variances and covariances</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta0 ~~ eta0</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta1 ~~ eta1</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  eta0 ~~ eta1</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  # Model constraints with b2 as a new\r\nparameter</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda11 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 1)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda21 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 2)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda31 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 3)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda41 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 4)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda51 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 5)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  lambda61 := 1 - exp(-b2 * 6)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  # Define b2 as a free parameter</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  b2 := b2_free</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>&#39;</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b># Define b2 as a free\r\nparameter in the model constraints</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>model.constraint &lt;- &#39;</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>  b2_free &gt; 0.5  &#39;</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b># Combine the model and\r\nconstraints</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>full_model &lt;-\r\npaste(model, model.constraint)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b># Fit the model, allowing\r\nfor missing data with maximum likelihood estimation</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>fit &lt;- lavaan(full_model,\r\ndata = Kanfer, missing = &quot;ml&quot;, estimator = &quot;mlr&quot;)</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b> </b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b># Display the summary of the\r\nresults</b></font></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><b>summary(fit, fit.measures =\r\nTRUE, standardized = TRUE)</b></font></span></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">The model does not run. I have tried different solutions. I think the problem is how to define the &#39;b2&#39; parameter in the lavaan syntax.<br>This problem must be general in all exponential models, can someone help me with the syntax?</font><br></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">I thank your attention,</font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">Jesús F Rosel</font></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "AaoiE3K6BgAJ",
   "from": "Terrence Jorgensen",
   "author": "3fe90052fbf2f899",
   "date": "2024-08-16T14:00:00Z",
   "subject": "Re: Exponential model",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">I think the problem is how to define the &#39;b2&#39; parameter in the lavaan syntax.</font></p></div></blockquote><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div><div>Correct, you are not defining it correctly.  There is not NEW operator in lavaan, like there is in Mplus, but you can create one as the mean of an arbitrary &quot;phantom construct&quot; that is measured by nothing (and whose (co)variances are all 0).  See this old post:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356196000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2_uofbr64sxflWWotvIXWc\">https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ</a> </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">ph =~ 0<br>ph ~ NA*1 + label(&quot;b2&quot;)*1 + 1?1 # free it, label it, start it at 1<br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">b2 &gt; 0.5 # constrain it to be &gt; 0.5</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">## constrain loadings</font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">(do not &quot;define&quot; them with := operator)</span></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">  lambda11 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 1)<br>  lambda21 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 2)<br>  lambda31 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 3)<br>  lambda41 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 4)<br>  lambda51 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 5)<br>  lambda61 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 6)</font><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px\"><div><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Terrence D. Jorgensen <span lang=\"EN-US\">   (he, him, his)</span><br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" title=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(0,120,215);text-decoration-line:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356196000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1ppfIkZ4Qo9JaV6s55M3Fs\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</span></a></p></div></div><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><br></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "SWC9rsC-BgAJ",
