   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Dear Terrence,<div>I very much appreciate your quick response. I had been &#39;fighting&#39; with the model for some time due to my poor definition of the b2 parameter in the lavaan syntax. I will put your kind suggestion in my model.<br></div><div>Kind regards,<br><br>Jesus Rosel<br></div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">El vie, 16 ago 2024 a las 16:00, Terrence Jorgensen (&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tjorge...@gmail.com</a>&gt;) escribió:<br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><blockquote style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div><p style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:normal\"><font size=\"5\" face=\"Sans Serif\">I think the problem is how to define the &#39;b2&#39; parameter in the lavaan syntax.</font></p></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div>Correct, you are not defining it correctly.  There is not NEW operator in lavaan, like there is in Mplus, but you can create one as the mean of an arbitrary &quot;phantom construct&quot; that is measured by nothing (and whose (co)variances are all 0).  See this old post:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356197000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1WEVltm6OjPGicfiHDZgwg\">https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/_-4zClO8oj8/m/wT3gaK_sBgAJ</a> </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">ph =~ 0<br>ph ~ NA*1 + label(&quot;b2&quot;)*1 + 1?1 # free it, label it, start it at 1<br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">b2 &gt; 0.5 # constrain it to be &gt; 0.5</font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">## constrain loadings</font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">(do not &quot;define&quot; them with := operator)</span></div><div><font face=\"Courier New\">  lambda11 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 1)<br>  lambda21 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 2)<br>  lambda31 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 3)<br>  lambda41 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 4)<br>  lambda51 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 5)<br>  lambda61 == 1 - exp(-b2 * 6)</font><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"color:rgb(33,33,33);font-family:Aptos;font-size:16px\"><div><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">Terrence D. Jorgensen <span lang=\"EN-US\">   (he, him, his)</span><br>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics<br>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam<br><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" title=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(0,120,215);text-decoration-line:underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356197000&amp;usg=AOvVaw10Ks3pzbwjj0IqumRkiIPT\"><span style=\"color:rgb(5,99,193)\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</span></a></p></div></div><p style=\"margin:0cm;font-size:10pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><br></p></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to a topic in the Google Groups &quot;lavaan&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this topic, visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/topic/lavaan/wmyCFYiAa2E/unsubscribe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/topic/lavaan/wmyCFYiAa2E/unsubscribe&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356197000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2VcHJ-qOeRD-Myk1rulg2Z\">https://groups.google.com/d/topic/lavaan/wmyCFYiAa2E/unsubscribe</a>.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and all its topics, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lavaan+un...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/768ef5ef-569e-4cb7-8bb4-d75247f024c4n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/768ef5ef-569e-4cb7-8bb4-d75247f024c4n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792414356198000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0i430luHmwEiTskIWXu4oL\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/lavaan/768ef5ef-569e-4cb7-8bb4-d75247f024c4n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n"
